{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38844","headline":"旅泊遇郡中叛乱示同志 · 杜荀鹤","name":"旅泊遇郡中叛乱示同志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"握手相看谁敢言，军家刀劒在腰边。\n遍搜宝货无藏处，乱杀平人不怕天。\n古寺拆爲修寨木，荒坟开作甃城塼。\n郡侯逐出浑闲事，正是銮舆幸蜀年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}